a few points why Posit is so

00:02:49.285 --> 00:02:52.560
invested in open source data
science especially in the

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:54.900
context of sharing
and collaborating.

00:02:56.480 --> 00:03:00.105
First, open source data
science is free. Meaning,

00:03:00.105 --> 00:03:02.745
if you want to share
your workflow with someone else,

00:03:02.745 --> 00:03:05.385
there is no requirement
to purchase any software.

00:03:05.385 --> 00:03:09.670
All the components needed to run
the workflow are completely free of charge.

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:14.390
Second, open source data
science, it promotes transparency.

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:17.275
Now when you share a
workflow with someone,

00:03:17.275 --> 00:03:18.795
they will know everything,

00:03:18.795 --> 00:03:22.315
and I mean everything that
went into your analyses because they

00:03:22.315 --> 00:03:24.530
have access to
your source code.

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:28.610
There's no proprietary or black
box analyses that are hidden

00:03:28.610 --> 00:03:29.510
from your collaborators.

00:03:30.530 --> 00:03:34.555
And finally, open source data
science allows teams to easily

00:03:34.555 --> 00:03:36.555
collaborate with
specific people,

00:03:36.555 --> 00:03:39.190
but also with the greater
data science community.

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:42.390
